  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Cheap Tequila**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Big River**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Señor (Tales of Yankee Power)**: back after 85 archived shows (600 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-05-05** (recommended): audience recording; 15 songs; 90 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taped from the left side, outside the VIP rail, roughly 20 feet back from the speaker stacks [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-05-05**: taped by seedy; transferred by seedy; source: Audience->Schoeps MK41 [1]. Also: Audience recording made with Schoeps MK41 microphones, Naiant Tinybox preamp, and a Sony PCM-A10 recorder, taped by seedy [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Andrew O'Brien: [New Orleans Jazz Fest In 3 Hours: Billy Strings, Bettye LaVette, Ziggy Marley, More Open Weekend 2 Photos/Videos](https://liveforlivemusic.com/features/new-orleans-jazz-fest-billy-strings-three-hours-05-05-22-photos-videos/) [3]\n- Fan art by Andrew O'Brien: [New Orleans Jazz Fest In 3 Hours: Billy Strings, Bettye LaVette, Ziggy Marley, More Open Weekend 2 Photos/Videos](https://liveforlivemusic.com/features/new-orleans-jazz-fest-billy-strings-three-hours-05-05-22-photos-videos/) [4]\n- Fan art by Andrew O'Brien: [New Orleans Jazz Fest In 3 Hours: Billy Strings, Bettye LaVette, Ziggy Marley, More Open Weekend 2 Photos/Videos](https://liveforlivemusic.com/features/new-orleans-jazz-fest-billy-strings-three-hours-05-05-22-photos-videos/) [5]\n- Fan art by Andrew O'Brien: [New Orleans Jazz Fest In 3 Hours: Billy Strings, Bettye LaVette, Ziggy Marley, More Open Weekend 2 Photos/Videos](https://liveforlivemusic.com/features/new-orleans-jazz-fest-billy-strings-three-hours-05-05-22-photos-videos/) [6]",
